From: Wengling Chen <feiyu2817@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jan 2020 18:01:56 -0500
Subject: Fix build error caused by the removal of safe_browsing

Rebased against Chromium 150.0.7871.x (2026-07-11); weblayer hunks dropped
(weblayer removed upstream).

UGC's fix-building-without-safebrowsing deletes safe_browsing_prefs.{h,cc},
which Android-only targets and the Android Safe Browsing settings UI still
reference. Drops those references and the generated SafeBrowsingState enum
dependency.

